Package: fjfsim
Title: Data Simulator of the FJF-2026 Programme
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Francisco", "Fernández", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Generates the raw, EDC-like data of the fictional studies FJF-2026-201 and
    FJF-2026-301 from the programme's design files and a truth drawn from a sealed seed
    (ADR 0018). The analysis code never loads this package.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.4)
Imports: purrr, stats, tibble, withr, yaml
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
